----------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This repository contains ONLY the application code (the Electron/HTML/JS
files in this repo). It does NOT bundle any Go engine or neural-net weights.

To actually run the app you need to supply your own:

  * KataGo          - https://github.com/lightvector/KataGo
                      Code and content released under the MIT license.
  * KataGo weights  - https://katagotraining.org/
  * LoGos (7B)      - https://huggingface.co/YichuanMa/LoGos-7B
                      Model card lists Apache-2.0, but the project's own README
                      states the data is CC BY-NC 4.0 and "for research use only".
                      Treat it as NON-COMMERCIAL.
  * llama.cpp       - https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp  (MIT)
                      Provides llama-server, used to serve the LoGos model.

Those components keep their own licenses; nothing here changes them.
